OL,3,ABollywood actor Tiger Shroff survives
OL,4,Ashooting attempt in Mumbai
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in India's Mumbai city are
OL,7,Finvestigating a shooting attempt on
OL,8,FBollywood actor Tiger Shroff, who
OL,9,Fsurvived without sustaining any gunshot
OL,10,Fwounds.
OL,12,FThe 36-year-old was shot at on Sunday
OL,13,Fevening while he was in a car leaving a
OL,14,Ffootball ground in Juhu suburb. Videos
OL,15,Fshowed at least two men firing multiple
OL,16,Fshots at close range at the front
OL,17,Fpassenger seat of Shroff's car while it
OL,18,Fwas moving slowly past a crowd.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
