OL,3,ABollywood actor Tiger Shroff survives
OL,4,Ashooting attempt in Mumbai
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people, including Shroff's driver,
OL,7,Fwere injured, according to the police.
OL,8,FThree people were detained in Rajasthan
OL,9,Fon Monday in connection with the
OL,10,Fincident, the police said.
OL,12,FThe attack has sent shockwaves through
OL,13,FBollywood, with celebrities raising
OL,14,Fconcerns about Shroff's safety.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
